# Human-editable 3x6 TIA object microglyphs.
# This file is covered under CC0-1.0. See examples/LICENSE.txt.
#
# Each bitmap row is M0_M1_P0_P1_BL_PF.  X is a lit pixel and . is blank.
# Collision-pair icons concatenate two 3-pixel object glyphs, giving one
# 6-pixel icon.  Keep row 4 (the all-blank middle row below) blank: the
# generated active form fills that row to make a latched collision obvious.
XX._XX._XXX_XXX_XX._XX.
XX._XX._XXX_XXX_XX._XX.
X.._X.._X.X_X.X_XX._X..
..._..._..._..._..._...
X.._.X._X.._.X._X.._XX.
.X._X.._.X._X.._XX._X..

# The six-pixel spare slot at lower right becomes this check mark only when
# the collision bitmap exactly matches the three collisions driven by the
# current animation.  It is otherwise blank.
PASS
......
.....X
....X.
X..X..
.XX...
......
